<plugin_modification_date>2025/06/27</plugin_modification_date>
<plugin_name>Microsoft Windows Remote Listeners Enumeration (WMI)</plugin_name>
<plugin_publication_date>2008/09/23</plugin_publication_date>
<plugin_type>local</plugin_type>
<risk_factor>None</risk_factor>
<script_version>1.278</script_version>
<solution>n/a</solution>
<synopsis>It is possible to obtain the names of processes listening on the remote UDP and TCP ports.</synopsis>
<plugin_output>
The Win32 process &apos;svchost.exe&apos; is listening on this port (pid 1536).

This process &apos;svchost.exe&apos; (pid 1536) is hosting the following Windows services :
EventLog (@%SystemRoot%\system32\wevtsvc.dll,-200)

</plugin_output>
</ReportItem>
