<cpe>cpe:/a:microsoft:.net_core</cpe>
<cvss3_base_score>10.0</cvss3_base_score>
<cvss3_vector>CVSS:3.0/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:H</cvss3_vector>
<cvss_base_score>10.0</cvss_base_score>
<cvss_score_rationale>Tenable standard unsupported software score.</cvss_score_rationale>
<cvss_score_source>manual</cvss_score_source>
<cvss_vector>CVSS2#AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C</cvss_vector>
<description>According to its version, the Microsoft .NET Core installed on the remote host is no longer maintained by its vendor or provider.

Lack of support implies that no new security patches for the product will be released by the vendor. As a result, it may contain security vulnerabilities.</description>
<fname>microsoft_dotnet_core_seol.nasl</fname>
<plugin_modification_date>2023/03/07</plugin_modification_date>
<plugin_name>Microsoft .NET Core SEoL</plugin_name>
<plugin_publication_date>2023/03/07</plugin_publication_date>
<plugin_type>local</plugin_type>
<risk_factor>Critical</risk_factor>
<script_version>1.0</script_version>
<see_also>http://www.nessus.org/u?89faa62b</see_also>
<solution>Upgrade to a version of Microsoft .NET Core that is currently supported.</solution>
<synopsis>An unsupported version of Microsoft .NET Core is installed on the remote host.</synopsis>
<unsupported_by_vendor>true</unsupported_by_vendor>
<plugin_output>
  Path                                   : C:\Program Files\dotnet\shared\Microsoft.NetCore.App\7.0.20\
  Installed version                      : 7.0.20.33720
  Security End of Life                   : May 13, 2024
  Time since Security End of Life (Est.) : &gt;= 1 year
</plugin_output>
</ReportItem>
