<solution>Make sure that the use of USB drives is in accordance with your organization&apos;s security policy.</solution>
<synopsis>It was possible to get a list of USB devices that may have been connected to the remote system in the past.</synopsis>
<thorough_tests>true</thorough_tests>
<plugin_output>
